                      (        forth.asm):03705         * Double (numerator high/low) gets divided by a single cell number. Please note
                      (        forth.asm):03706         * that this is a strictly unsigned business. Input parameters are supposed to
                      (        forth.asm):03707         * have been set up by the caller on the system stack. The quotient (high/low)
